             272                     
             273                     !..Lookup tables for various accretion/collection terms.
             274                     !.. ntb_x refers to the number of elements for rain, snow, graupel,
             275                     !.. and temperature array indices.  Variables beginning with t-p/c/m/n
             276                     !.. represent lookup tables.  Save compile-time memory by making
