            2716                     !..Sedimentation of mixing ratio is the integral of v(D)*m(D)*N(D)*dD,
            2717                     !.. whereas neglect m(D) term for number concentration.  Therefore,
            2718                     !.. cloud ice has proper differential sedimentation.
            2719                     !.. New in v3.0+ is computing separate for rain, ice, snow, and
            2720                     !.. graupel species thus making code faster with credit to J. Schmidt.
